{"title": "I Have a Serious Complaint!", "pageid": 30806, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/I_Have_a_Serious_Complaint!", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Note_M_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Book_Note_M_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_M_Image.png.webp, /w/images/8/89/Book_Note_M_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"I Have a Serious Complaint! image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Book_Note_M_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_M_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Book_Note_M_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Is a note from Lady Madeline Whitburn complaining to <a href=\"/wiki/Bonecloak%27s_Apothecary\" title=\"Bonecloak's Apothecary\">Bonecloak's Apothecary</a> that the potion they purchased to cure Lord Whitburn's stiffness problem didn't work.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This book is redolent with the enticing smell of paper and ink.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/38px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/50px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Notes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\">Notes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Madeline Whitburn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Madeline_Whitburn\" title=\"Madeline Whitburn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/38px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/50px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Madeline Whitburn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Madeline_Whitburn\" title=\"Madeline Whitburn\">Madeline Whitburn</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-396a200555748ba4END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-d9d1df8d20f7cc70END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Complaint</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Complaint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Complaint\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">3a4fb92b-b14a-4b71-aff6-388fae0949ec</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3a4fb92b-b14a-4b71-aff6-388fae0949ec\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3a4fb92b-b14a-4b71-aff6-388fae0949ec\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Bonecloak%27s_Apothecary\" title=\"Bonecloak's Apothecary\">Bonecloak's Apothecary</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-20&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-33</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Management, Bonecloak's Apothecary -\n</p><p><br>\nI have a complaint to make! I recently purchased, through Blathers my butler, a potion that he was assured would help with Lord Whitburn's stiffness problem, but I gave Whit a double dose of your 'Rigid-Quik Cordial' in his sherry last night and it didn't help AT ALL.\n</p><p><br>\nI want my money back, and immediately!  ...Unless, maybe, you have an alternative remedy that might help? You can talk to Blathers discreetly about it, he has my full confidence.\n</p><p><br>\n- Lady Madeline Whitburn\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>It is not clear if the mentioned <i>Lord Whitburn</i> is the same as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Whitburn\" title=\"Lord Whitburn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png/38px-Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png/50px-Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lord Whitburn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Portrait_Lord_Whitburn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Whitburn\" title=\"Lord Whitburn\">Lord Whitburn</a>, who can be found near the <a href=\"/wiki/Glitter_Gala\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Glitter Gala\">Glitter Gala</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>, together with a noble woman named <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Whitburn\" title=\"Lady Whitburn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Portrait_Lady_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Lady_Whitburn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Portrait_Lady_Whitburn.png/38px-Portrait_Lady_Whitburn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Portrait_Lady_Whitburn.png/50px-Portrait_Lady_Whitburn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Whitburn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Portrait_Lady_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Lady_Whitburn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Portrait_Lady_Whitburn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Whitburn\" title=\"Lady Whitburn\">Lady Whitburn</a>. The relationship between <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Madeline_Whitburn\" title=\"Madeline Whitburn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/38px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/50px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Madeline Whitburn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png/25px-Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/Portrait_Madeline_Whitburn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Madeline_Whitburn\" title=\"Madeline Whitburn\">Lady Madeline Whitburn</a> and the other two Whitburns is unclear.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715061621\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2375/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 39466/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11735/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 979910/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.858      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   48.858      1 -total\n 58.85%   28.752     10 Template:Icon_text\n 50.95%   24.895     23 Template:Trim\n 21.40%   10.453      2 Template:Uid\n 19.48%    9.518